			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 412120601,
					"content": "前面没有路了，只有一个很大的山洞入口。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120602
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412120602,
					"content": "是跑进去了吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120603
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 412120603,
					"content": "从脚印的情况来看，它跑进去了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120604
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412120604,
					"content": "那我们也跟上去吧！不要让它跑远了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120605
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412120605,
					"content": "等等。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120606
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412120606,
					"content": "这座雪山体积惊人，山腹内就算有路，也不会是一马平川的那种。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120607
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412120607,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120608
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412120608,
					"content": "感觉到了吗？带着冰原和山石气味的风…还有回声，里面的空间一定很大。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120609
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412120609,
					"content": "还真是！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120610
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412120610,
					"content": "所以，轻举妄动对我们没有好处。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120611
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412120611,
					"content": "可是…都已经追到这里了，总不能让它白白跑掉吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120612
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412120612,
					"content": "那本素描本对你很重要吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120613
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 412120613,
					"content": "很重要，但也不能莽撞行事。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120614
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412120614,
					"content": "还有另一条路，只是要费些功夫。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120615
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412120615,
					"content": "没猜错的话，这个山洞的出口在山体另一侧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120616
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412120616,
					"content": "你很擅长飞行，我的技术也还不错。做好准备吧，我们一口气飞过去。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				}
			]
		},
