					"content": "阿贝多，应急工作做得还顺利吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120702
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412120702,
					"content": "还行。有几页遭到破坏，但大部分完好无损。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120703
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412120703,
					"content": "雪山气温太低，尤其是那个山洞，附近的气温已经达到了极限…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120704
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412120704,
					"content": "何况丘丘人还把口水弄在了本子上。结冰的纸落在那样的低温里，真是不堪设想。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120705
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412120705,
					"content": "结冰的纸那么脆，一碰就碎了吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120706
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412120706,
					"content": "真亏你有办法把素描本救回来。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120707
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 412120707,
					"content": "不愧是炼金术士，心灵手巧呀。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120708
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412120708,
					"content": "要是本子损坏严重的话，阿贝多一定会大发雷霆吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120709
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412120709,
					"content": "为什么你会这样想？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120710
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412120710,
					"content": "因为你说过上面有很多图画和笔记。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120711
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412120711,
					"content": "确实如此，这本素描本一直被我带在身边。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120712
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412120712,
					"content": "不过，也不至于为这种事太过生气。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120713
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412120713,
					"content": "如果真的抢救不回来，重新画过就好。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120714
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412120714,
					"content": "咦…这种时候倒很现实了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120715,
						412120716
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412120715,
					"content": "我不这么想。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120717
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 412120717,
					"content": "是吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120718
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412120718,
					"content": "不管怎么说，那都是你用心绘制的画。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120719
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 412120719,
					"content": "对呀对呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120720
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412120720,
					"content": "画作承载的是记忆。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120721
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 412120721,
					"content": "是的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120722
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412120722,
					"content": "别轻易放弃与回忆有关的东西。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120723
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 412120723,
					"content": "#正是如此！哎呀，{NICKNAME}说得真不错，其实我想说的也是这些。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120724
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412120724,
					"content": "…也是。重画很麻烦，我不喜欢这样。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120725
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412120725,
					"content": "我猜是因为阿贝多很天才吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120726
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412120726,
					"content": "你看，你会那么多别人不会的技艺，懂得那么多别人不懂的道理！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120727
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412120727,
					"content": "这样的人有时反而会忽略细节呢。难道说这就是聪明的弊端吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120728
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412120728,
					"content": "阿贝多也说过派蒙聪明哦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120729
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 412120729,
					"content": "是的，派蒙是个很有趣的生物。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120730,
						412120731
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412120730,
					"content": "派蒙也会忽略细节吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120732
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 412120732,
					"content": "啊——不要在我说大道理的时候扯上我自己啦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120733
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412120733,
					"content": "那么，换个话题。之前塞琉斯说，雪山丘丘人会袭击冒险家，抢夺物资。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120734
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412120734,
					"content": "我们去的，应该就是这群丘丘人的据点之一。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120735
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412120735,
					"content": "这里的丘丘人很强。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120736
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 412120736,
					"content": "对，这一带的丘丘人，比山脚下那些丘丘人强不少呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120737
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412120737,
					"content": "我也有同样的感觉。我想…这仍然是与「龙」有关吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120738
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412120738,
					"content": "杜林亡骸中的污秽之力会强化怪物。再加上严寒气候，一些雪山区域便成了无人区。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120739
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412120739,
					"content": "旅行者，能把剑拿出来吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120740
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412120740,
					"content": "在雪山的每一次战斗，这把剑都会吸收力量，储存在剑身之内。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120741
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412120741,
					"content": "并且，由于你的净化，那些原本被龙血污染的力量，似乎都被提纯了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120742
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412120742,
					"content": "这是很有意思的现象。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120743
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412120743,
					"content": "这种事我们可熟悉了，非常拿手的哦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120744
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412120744,
					"content": "虽然知道你有这种力量，但…原来这就是净化，真是百闻不如一见。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120745
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412120745,
					"content": "能储存力量的剑，很危险吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120746
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 412120746,
					"content": "的确不能说是非常安全的武器。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120747
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412120747,
					"content": "幸好没被那些丘丘人抢走，否则我们就完了！那群雪山丘丘人会变得多强啊……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120748,
						412120749
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412120748,
					"content": "愚人众更危险吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120750
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 412120750,
					"content": "丘丘人也很危险呀！万一它们得到能量，变成…超级，不，究极丘丘人！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120751
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412120751,
					"content": "丘丘魔人！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120752
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 412120752,
					"content": "丘丘恶魔人！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120753
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412120753,
					"content": "丘丘恶魔雪人！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120754
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 412120754,
					"content": "为什么加了雪字，感觉一下就变得好弱…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120755
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412120755,
					"content": "说起来，这把剑这么厉害的话，是不是也能吸收阿贝多的力量？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120756
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412120756,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120757
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412120757,
					"content": "想试试吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120758
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412120758,
					"content": "呜哇！眼神一下变得冰凉了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120759,
						412120760
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412120759,
					"content": "派蒙是开玩笑…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120761
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 412120761,
					"content": "不，我没有生气。总之，希望你能继续使用这把剑。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120762
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412120762,
					"content": "就算这把剑那么危险，你仍然信任我们吗？好意外呀。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120763
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412120763,
					"content": "阿贝多，看起来是这样，心里却好像是那样的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120764
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412120764,
					"content": "这样、那样…是怎么样。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120765
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412120765,
					"content": "说起我信任你们的原因…那或许是因为…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120766
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412120766,
					"content": "「异类」之间的，某种共识吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120767
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412120767,
					"content": "异类？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120768
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 412120768,
					"content": "孤独的个体…与普通人不同的个体，就像…你和我。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120769,
						412120770
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412120769,
					"content": "（……？）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": []
				},
				{
					"id": 412120770,
					"content": "（这句话，有特别的含义吗？）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": []
				},
				{
					"id": 412120760,
					"content": "派蒙没有恶意…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120761
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 412120749,
					"content": "盗宝团更危险吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120750
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 412120731,
					"content": "派蒙该不会也有弊端吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120732
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 412120716,
					"content": "这种时候应该生气一点哦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120717
					]
				}
			]
		},
